	(descr "Cherry MX style, Kailh Choc V1 (PG1350) and V2 (PG1353) low profile mechanical keyboard switch, hot-swap socket, single-sided mounting. Plate cut lines: User.1=15.60mm square (cosmetic cover, all switches), User.2=14.00mm square (MX / MX Low Profile / Gateron Low Profile), User.3=13.95mm square (Kailh Choc V2), User.4=13.80mm square (Kailh Choc V1). Keycap: 6.25u (courtyard 119.01x19.00mm). Kailh Choc 1350 stabilizer: PCB cutout slots (Edge.Cuts) and plate cuts on User.5. Plate required.")
